From: Shreenidhi Shedi <sshedi@vmware.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Feb 2022 16:17:38 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] Migrate rpmdb to /usr/lib/sysimage/rpm

Reference:  https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/RelocateRPMToUsr

Signed-off-by: Shreenidhi Shedi <sshedi@vmware.com>
---
 macros.in | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/macros.in b/macros.in
index da3a6bc..13960a1 100644
--- a/macros.in
+++ b/macros.in
@@ -118,7 +118,7 @@
 %_buildshell		/bin/sh
 
 #	The location of the rpm database file(s).
-%_dbpath		%{_var}/lib/rpm
+%_dbpath		%{_usr}/lib/sysimage/rpm
 
 #	The location of the rpm database file(s) after "rpm --rebuilddb".
 %_dbpath_rebuild	%{_dbpath}
